{"ts": "2026-08-17T10:50:49Z", "agent": "claude", "seq": 223, "kind": "tool_result", "text": "`docs/design.md` is written for Taiga #3 (edit a task title), overwriting round 1's filter-feature design per this pipeline's per-cycle `docs/` convention.\n\n**Key decisions:**\n- No new component \u2014 edit mode is per-row local state inside `TaskList.jsx` (a small `TaskRow` helper), reusing `App.css`'s existing button/input styles exactly.\n- Empty-title rejection uses **both** a disabled Save (mirroring `AddTask`) and an inline `.field-error` message on submit attempt, since a disabled button alone won't catch the Enter-key path.\n- Failed saves keep edit mode open with the draft intact for retry, using the existing global error banner \u2014 no new UI pattern.\n- Reused the app's existing error red (`#a3271d`) for the field error text; computed contrast on white is **7.33:1**, clearing both the 4.5:1 AA and 7:1 AAA text thresholds.\n- Flagged one implementation subtlety for the developer: the sketch closes edit mode optimistically on submit, but the \"stays open on failure\" decision requires awaiting `onUpdate` before closing \u2014 noted explicitly so it's not lost in translation.\n\nNext stage is **developer**, to implement against `docs/spec.md` + `docs/design.md`.", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_017DmG4NiTeNBwfejERkTiug", "session_id": "b32343ef-8914-468a-8d74-824b5074f2c5"}}
