{"ts": "2026-08-17T10:50:56Z", "agent": "claude", "seq": 230, "kind": "tool_result", "text": "commit 531fc286e38fd5d8d3b929c36d764a86bf880d58\nMerge: 2437cae 12423bd\nAuthor: Your Name <you@example.com>\nDate:   Mon Aug 17 10:46:54 2026 +0000\n\n    Merge round 2: Edit a task title\n\n backend/app/main.py                  |   8 +\n backend/app/store.py                 |   7 +\n backend/tests/test_tasks.py          |  41 +++\n docs/design.md                       | 550 +++++++++++++++++++++--------------\n docs/spec.md                         | 215 ++++++++------\n e2e/test_tasks_e2e.py                | 102 +++++++\n frontend/src/App.css                 |  15 +\n frontend/src/App.jsx                 |   3 +\n frontend/src/api.js                  |   2 +\n frontend/src/components/TaskList.jsx |  96 +++++-\n 10 files changed, 714 insertions(+), 325 deletions(-)", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01PZ3o7j4K6WVxV1ZhQkMrjw", "session_id": "b32343ef-8914-468a-8d74-824b5074f2c5"}}
